# The image installs its own dependencies (the deps stage runs `npm ci`), so the
# host's must not follow `COPY . .` in and replace them: they are built for the
# host's platform. esbuild is where that stopped being hypothetical — its binary
# from a Mac checkout is not something Alpine can run.
